@startuml
actor 用户
participant "前端页面" as Frontend
participant "SysUserController" as Controller
participant "SysUserService" as Service
participant "SysUserMapper" as Mapper
participant "数据库" as DB

用户 -> Frontend: 输入注册信息并提交
Frontend -> Controller: POST /sysUser/register
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: register(userRegisterDTO)
activate Service
Service -> Mapper: selectOne(wrapper)
activate Mapper
Mapper -> DB: 查询用户信息
activate DB
DB --> Mapper: 返回查询结果
deactivate DB
Mapper --> Service: 返回用户信息
deactivate Mapper
alt 用户名称重复
    Service -> Service: 抛出CustomException("用户名称重复")
    Service --> Controller: 异常信息
    Controller --> Frontend: 返回错误响应
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate Service
else 用户名称不重复
    Service -> Service: 生成盐值、加密密码等操作
    Service -> Mapper: saveOrUpdate(user)
    activate Mapper
    Mapper -> DB: 插入或更新用户信息
    activate DB
    DB --> Mapper: 操作结果
    deactivate DB
    Mapper --> Service: 操作结果
    deactivate Mapper
    Service --> Controller: 注册成功
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> Frontend: 返回成功响应
    deactivate Controller

@enduml